## 6. API 端點

### 6.1 對話 (Tab A)
```
POST   /api/conversations                         → 建立對話
GET    /api/conversations                         → 對話列表
GET    /api/conversations/:id                     → 取得對話（含歷史訊息）
POST   /api/conversations/:id/messages            → 發送訊息（呼叫 Claude）
POST   /api/conversations/:id/export              → 匯出 testcase (JSON + MD)
POST   /api/conversations/:id/push-to-run         → 推送到 Tab B
DELETE /api/conversations/:id                     → 刪除對話
```

### 6.2 測試執行 (Tab B)
```
POST   /api/runs                                  → 建立 run
GET    /api/runs/:id                              → run 詳情
GET    /api/runs/:id/summary                      → run 摘要統計
GET    /api/runs/:id/cases                        → case 結果列表
GET    /api/runs/:id/steps                        → step 結果列表
GET    /api/runs/:id/logs                         → 執行 log
GET    /api/runs/:id/approvals                    → approval 列表
POST   /api/runs/:id/start                        → 開始執行
POST   /api/runs/:id/approve                      → 授權恢復
POST   /api/runs/:id/skip-case                    → 跳過當前 case
POST   /api/runs/:id/manual-fill                  → 手動回填結果
POST   /api/runs/:id/cancel                       → 取消 run
GET    /api/runs/:id/artifacts                    → 取得產出檔案
```

### 6.3 執行紀錄 (Tab B-1)
```
GET    /api/runs/history?page=1&pageSize=20&status=&roundId=  → 歷史列表
```

### 6.4 儀表板 (Tab C — 未來)
```
GET    /api/dashboard/index
GET    /api/dashboard/cases?roundId=xxx
GET    /api/dashboard/bugs?roundId=xxx
GET    /api/dashboard/stats?roundId=xxx
```

### 6.5 整合
```
POST   /api/integrations/google-sheets/sync
GET    /api/integrations/google-sheets/status
```

